            <div xml:id="m-472254ca-8d1f-4773-9748-5ed3c23b9721">
              <lg xml:id="m-a920e821-a34a-4e8e-92e1-aa04fefc1de8">
                <l xml:id="m-c55964c1-6f9b-40da-8dd5-6924e9e42160" facs="#m-aad66e94-0093-4901-8d67-2abe4797a14a" label="text-like">The Dedication of a Church. Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-085e1116-9c93-41c0-82d0-20564cacb12b" facs="#m-cd4ca72a-eb1f-4b87-8122-82f610dd5b12" label="ambiguous">1246</l><l xml:id="m-a2d6afce-1d22-4a8f-bb32-041d829e34e9" facs="#m-4c1e106a-41a8-4435-8b87-2121164f73b7" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-55253545-a9c6-4079-b9c8-a992655cb3e6" facs="#m-7309d4d2-7759-400a-bcab-69e5c8550157" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Lápides pretiósi. p. 1247. Psalms of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-6a08bbd7-0bdf-437a-ad76-6e52dc290aa5" facs="#m-fcb307e1-0fad-4369-94b3-469244adb24c" label="ambiguous">Apoc. 21. b.</l><l xml:id="m-e6683b13-92ab-43b1-86ce-5fa8cc9a71d8" facs="#m-f123d8d4-33bd-4094-b552-075c30f726a4" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-7904b1dd-1346-4927-a182-d4bb1b03db70" facs="#m-88262663-6e9c-4c13-a284-dbb631ccf358" label="lyrics-like">(T abstérget Deus omnem lácri-] ultra, quia prima abiérunt. *Et</l><l xml:id="m-1a9ef268-6400-453c-b431-69918cbed347" facs="#m-a8873abd-161d-4191-b668-911cd2e4ab34" label="lyrics-like">Umam ab óculis eórum: t et! dixit qui sedébat in throno: Ecce</l><l xml:id="m-216b8ec7-a00a-4fca-8c24-9b49c94e5069" facs="#m-c1c84267-5601-45ea-acd5-cc09d439b913" label="lyrics-like">mors ultra non erit, neque luctus,] nova fácio ómnia.</l><l xml:id="m-04dd9f1f-a7c2-4c0a-a932-2d6f9975ab4f" facs="#m-39b8a16a-6713-4e8f-b4e6-9917675816ec" label="ambiguous">neque clamor, neque dolor erit</l><l xml:id="m-6cdfd73b-fd4f-4b8a-a3a3-07d20248bfe5" facs="#m-94a69c83-3f9e-48d0-9bd6-b3f40629dc8c" label="ambiguous">short!</l><l xml:id="m-cfd1de8f-8266-4358-aab6-68ca3eaf3819" facs="#m-edcbf464-bc25-421e-bcd0-85f9d38fa4a0" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-4481c89e-5c12-4445-838f-41bb7ed7a984" facs="#m-790f4216-d232-441c-9339-9b5297835de7" label="lyrics-like">Aec est dómus Dómi-ni“Firmi-ter aedi-fi-cá-ta.</l><l xml:id="m-7dc78372-fb28-4334-aa99-75b70668f135" facs="#m-6f5ec12c-9255-4e2c-bb05-d1e18b0e1b8f" label="lyrics-like">V. Bene fundá-ta est supra fírmam pétram. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-9f444aef-c5e7-4040-bd47-55daea3d2e15" facs="#m-8d4e9eae-93ac-4d07-914a-4ee2ff9fd5d0" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-4237a6ef-6b51-4f2f-8d08-8ad10599f7f8" facs="#m-6ffe1540-27f1-4eb8-bd93-9e61d01c0c34" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-c751921f-a4f5-496c-9949-c745c2246b9e" facs="#m-ae3e5aa8-a187-4d9f-bdee-855dc10f1913" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-a24a6b4a-a945-4167-8dc5-fc66ca0ed674" facs="#m-d90c03eb-2019-425a-8dde-d7a6b388fdf7" label="lyrics-like">It Aec est dómus Dómi-ni firmi-ter aedi-fi-cá-ta:</l><l xml:id="m-ec477b3e-b63d-475e-bf3b-6a20e0a7a1a9" facs="#m-4467298e-1a01-40fe-aa66-f35aeca8d865" label="lyrics-like">Alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia. V. Bene fundá-ta est supra fírmam</l><l xml:id="m-6d1a1ce3-6e09-4038-a233-59b81f3aa4da" facs="#m-7e5939fa-5794-4ca7-a2b0-3aef8a8913bb" label="lyrics-like">pétram. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-12c11a27-8706-4a29-b6ed-060c582fa98f" facs="#m-9225030f-58b7-4120-bcae-38ae348916c1" label="lyrics-like">V. Bene fundáta est dómus Dómini. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-ec14fc6d-a18a-44fd-b8a9-74527e8fee49" facs="#m-1b0acdeb-f752-4b49-8da3-61da9cc68895" label="lyrics-like">K. Supra firmam pétram. (T. P. Alleluia.)</l><l xml:id="m-91ec4b7b-6dc8-4f41-9fc6-e47a422bc68e" facs="#m-338eaec6-36da-488c-8fd6-c217539dea9d" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-0656cca2-c892-4305-bb7f-7bdd48249fa9" facs="#m-2d9c719c-8855-4867-a040-1068cb630b21" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Dixit Dóminus. 7. a. p. 132. — 2. Confitébor. 1. D :. p. 133.</l><l xml:id="m-e3284310-a6ca-435e-9728-03089468b196" facs="#m-02e88d74-3c24-41d0-8578-470204d6c0b9" label="lyrics-like">— 3. Beátus vir. I. f. p. 140. — 4. Laudáte púeri. 8. c. p. 152. — 5. Láuda</l><l xml:id="m-d0b47ee0-7293-4f99-8d4a-9bf8823ffc73" facs="#m-e02e0ea8-e059-4b18-a95f-c825ca5198f2" label="lyrics-like">Jerúsalem. 1. g. p. 202.</l><l xml:id="m-801c933e-fb07-4e02-92cb-42fb22f8bce0" facs="#m-88739438-4671-4f0e-9303-471fc813bbf5" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-82ce1b3b-c3b7-4170-abfb-2243b0a93ad7" facs="#m-20825c8f-c400-440d-bcfc-24962b818d8f" label="ambiguous">7.a</l><l xml:id="m-30039d01-f682-4e08-88ec-92cc32d7f23e" facs="#m-e6d00449-ab85-4593-be18-44be9274dee8" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-16c5ed6b-3646-477e-bc6d-8748f966c29b" facs="#m-88f370e1-ec0f-4e6c-a3c4-cc1df09e46a8" label="lyrics-like">Omum tú-am Dómine“ décet sancti-túdo,</l><l xml:id="m-d0bc92c5-cc46-4b57-af76-893063e4dff8" facs="#m-9cedf7a9-6fb6-47f9-ac2b-19a8f715b0b4" label="ambiguous">in</l></lg>
            </div>
